WEBVTT

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.490
- Hurry! Hurry!
- Battle stations!

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:42.080
Crash dive! Open vents!
Flood all tanks!

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.290
Aye, sir!

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.830
A bombardment?!

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.540
It's them. The Phantom Ship!

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:48.750
Hatch seal, all green!

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.500
Ahead full on port and
starboard caterpillar drives!

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:54.340
Near miss incoming 1-5-0 to starboard.
No, here it comes! It's in the water!

00:00:58.390 --> 00:00:59.760
Not bad.

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:01.350
We've got a report
from the patrol plane!

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:04.930
No doubt about it! They've surfaced
6 klicks off of Tateyama and are shelling!

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:06.600
<i>They've finally stuck</i>
<i>their ass out for us.</i>

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:07.730
Let's do it!
Prep a torpedo!

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.730
<i>Approaching on course 3-3-6,</i>
<i>bearing 3-3-7 low!</i>

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.360
Warhead checks out as active!

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:13.480
Holding at twenty meters.
Opening bomb bay doors!

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:15.530
<i>- 2-4-3. Range: 2000!</i>
- Safeties off.

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:17.860
Damn, would you look at
that thing! That monster!

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:22.410
<i>NOVO system has confirmed</i>
<i>the enemy's position!</i>

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:26.870
Prep U.S.M! Flood tubes 1 through 4,
then fire all simultaneously!

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.960
Captain!
Message from the Narushio!

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:32.630
<i>This isn't your problem! We'll</i>
<i>handle this! Hurry up and go!</i>

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:34.630
But...

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:37.470
<i>This is our backyard.</i>
<i>We'll defend it ourselves!</i>

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:44.470
<i>Come on, Iga. Your own</i>
<i>duties come first, right?</i>

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:50.390
What are you doing?
Get going!

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:52.650
Sorry.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:58.990
Cancel blow. Open all vents. Down trim:
30 degrees. Depth 100. Maximum speed!

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:01.820
- Depth 100, aye!
- Main engine stop!

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:04.370
Full feather.
Shifting engine types!

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.580
Caterpillars one and two,
ahead full!

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.370
Open all tubes!
Run us on a zig-zag course.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.630
Let's show 'em just
what an old boat's REALLY capable of!

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:33.850
Got 'em! Direct hit!

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.110
Let's cripple 'em.
Second round, FIRE!

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.910
Close all watertight hatches!

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:48.450
- Too late!
- We've lost electrical power!

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:49.700
Auxiliary's also gone!

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:53.790
- Don't let us down, Iga.
- Forward! Get forward!

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:12.390
Hurry! Once we've recovered
the women, get going after Blue 6.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:16.940
At last, I can go home
with good news for Papa!

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:34.310
Currently passing Heiseishin Island.
No ships or planes sighted.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:37.650
Nothing on sonar.
Course is clear.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:42.320
Commence dive. Down trim: 20. Take us to a
depth of 300 and hold at cruising speed.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:47.240
- Aye, sir.
- ETA: 16:20 UTC.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:51.580
Cut that out.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:00.880
What is it?

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:05.380
That MSDF boat,
couldn't we have saved it?

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:28.150
Tsuji? Could you send some food
down to the dock area?

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.910
Sure. I don't mind that.
Although him...

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:35.450
Hey! A lot of the boat's still heavily
damaged. So how about giving us a hand?

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:46.510
- What?
<i>- Message from headquarters, sir.</i>

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:49.130
<i>Tokyo base was destroyed</i>
<i>by the enemy bombardment.</i>

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:52.390
<i>They've decided to give up</i>
<i>in their last meeting.</i>

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.180
I see.

00:05:57.180 --> 00:06:01.400
So, we're the only
ones left now, huh?

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:26.920
The captain really takes too many risks.
He nearly got us all sunk!

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:30.090
Would you quit it?
It's really cramped in here!

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:33.510
How'd a big lummox like you
ever get to be a pilot?

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:35.470
Jeez.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.930
- Can I smoke?
- No!

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:42.270
- Irritated?
- Not really.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:45.110
It's not like we ran
because we wanted to run.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:49.190
It's just that we can't let anything
happen to this boat, no matter what.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.450
You think that's funny?

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:57.620
If you're so scared of losing it,
you should lock it up in a vault.

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:04.250
Papa! Papa! I've done it!

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:07.840
I've destroyed another
Blue Fleet base! I killed them all!

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:11.050
Everyone did
a wonderful job, Papa!

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:13.840
And soon we'll know
where their main base is, too!

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.850
<i>Verg. Don't take</i>
<i>too many risks.</i>

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:23.350
This time we'll finish them, Papa!
Those annoying pests.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:27.360
They won't get back to the land
alive! Not one of them!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.730
Give the order, Papa!

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:37.240
<i>Come home soon.</i>
<i>Take care of yourself.</i>

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:40.660
<i>We all pray for your safety.</i>

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:14.070
He prays! He prays.

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:19.370
This is no time for prayer!

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.830
I heard from your sisters.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:30.880
You were touched
by one of the land men.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:33.920
You were, weren't you?

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.720
Weren't you?

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.610
Blue Dome approach, this is Ryu-Oh,
Blue Fleet submarine number 6.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:53.320
Request docking clearance
into Blue Dome.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:56.400
<i>This is Blue base NOVO-0001.</i>

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:58.240
<i>Your ship's identity</i>
<i>is confirmed.</i>

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.910
<i>Cleared for base docking.</i>

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:07.250
<i>Welcome home,</i>
<i>"Slow Turtle" Blue 6!</i>

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:13.420
<i>Warning! Warning!</i>

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.800
<i>You're docking at too great</i>
<i>a depth! Danger! Danger!</i>

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:22.350
<i>Stop that at once! I will inform</i>
<i>sub driving control about this!</i>

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:26.140
Just try it! I'll dump you
into the Marianas Trench!

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:29.770
Okay, that's enough.
Frida's serious about that, NOVO!

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:31.690
<i>I don't understand.</i>

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.020
What's?

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:37.070
You saw the blueprints for it,
didn't you?

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:42.570
Yeah. A long time ago.
A really long time ago.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:28.580
God, you look so happy you're
gonna burst. Like a little kid.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.330
China, France, India.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:37.800
Aren't you honored?
You're part of Operation Blue.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.380
The plan that's going to
create a future for humanity.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:48.470
A future.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:56.650
We lost the Stream Base in
Antarctica two years ago.

00:10:56.770 --> 00:10:59.190
What have they been doing there?

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:01.570
Now that we've lost
our satellites...

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:04.530
we aren't able to peek in
and see what they're up to.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:21.170
With this knife called Stream Base
being held to its throat...

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:23.880
it's been all humanity could
do just to survive.

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:26.680
But it looks as though
our enemy has decided...

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:30.390
to make the final cut
and wipe us all out.

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:38.400
I believe you've all seen this. The aurora
which now covers the entire Earth.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:47.410
Zorndyke has triggered
a sudden pole shift...

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:50.910
which is eliminating the
Earth's magnetic field.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:57.380
Freed of its influence, the crust
will begin to move freely.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:01.710
Additionally, this pole shift...

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.880
is destroying the Van Allen
radiation belt!

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.470
Without it, mankind is doomed!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.930
If we don't attack Zorndyke's
Stream Base at once...

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.230
we have no future!

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:18.940
Well, then,
I'll explain the mission.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:22.150
We in the Pacific Fleet will
cross the Tonga Trench...

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.440
and approach Antarctica
from 170 degrees east longitude.

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:27.200
At the same time,
the Atlantic Fleet...

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.240
will come around the
continent from the east...

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:31.280
attack from 120
degrees east longitude...

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:33.160
and take control of Stream Base.

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:34.410
Owing to the limited
scope of this attack...

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.920
we should be able to take
Zorndyke's Stream Base completely.

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:44.630
<i>The only path left to humanity</i>
<i>is life or death.</i>

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:46.430
<i>Failure is not an option.</i>

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:55.140
<i>Let me repeat that: If this mission</i>
<i>fails, we have no future!</i>

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:58.440
I hope you all do your
best in this battle.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:02.860
Dr. Marunami, we have a signal
from Blue 1, the Coback.

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:06.570
<i>We heard you, Doctor.</i>
<i>An excellent speech, sir.</i>

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:09.240
What's the situation
with the Atlantic Fleet?

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:12.700
<i>No problems. We hold</i>
<i>the final cards here.</i>

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:16.160
<i>All you guys in the Pacific Fleet</i>
<i>have to do is back us up.</i>

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:19.500
<i>We'll be enough to</i>
<i>get rid of Zorndyke.</i>

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:21.460
As confident as ever,
I see, Admiral.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:24.590
<i>This is payback</i>
<i>for a billion people!</i>

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:28.680
<i>Hamurabi taught that the only</i>
<i>payback for death is death!</i>

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:33.560
<i>But, Admiral, you're a</i>
<i>Christian, are you not?</i>

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:34.890
Somebody's hacked
the I.S.S. line!

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:36.770
<i>No! That's impossible!</i>

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:44.650
ZORNDYKE!

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:46.900
- Zorndyke!
- It's Zorndyke?

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:51.700
<i>I converted the day you did it!</i>

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:55.200
<i>So that I could avenge my husband</i>
<i>and my three children!</i>

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:01.040
<i>Mankind. Mankind has</i>
<i>grown too large.</i>

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:04.880
<i>Ambitions and cravings,</i>
<i>vengeance and hatred.</i>

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:08.720
<i>How long must the</i>
<i>accursed dance continue?</i>

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:11.890
<i>The performance</i>
<i>must finally end.</i>

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.930
<i>And so you murder</i>
<i>people for that?</i>

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.220
<i>It is not murder.</i>

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:21.190
<i>I am merely advancing the</i>
<i>hands of the clock just a bit.</i>

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:24.900
<i>Before it is all too late.</i>

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:30.200
You think that
you can play God?

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:35.530
<i>Of course not. I am not</i>
<i>nearly so arrogant as that.</i>

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:40.120
- Zorndyke, you monster!
- Destroyer of the world!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:41.920
- We'll never forgive you!
- Revenge!

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.920
We'll make you pay
for our friends!

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.770
All right!
All right! All right!

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.270
Hey, have you seen Kino?

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:10.280
Oh, she's with that guy Hayami
in the dock again, isn't she?

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.490
Lucky stiffs! Getting a little
sweet lovin' in before we set sail!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:18.490
How about we do some, too?

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.000
By the way,

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:26.500
what's the story
with Hayami, anyway?

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:30.510
I heard he got court-martialed
before, right?

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:38.510
I dunno. I know
he's talented, but I dunno.

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:43.270
We've got twelve hours till we ship out!
Hurry up with those checks!

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:45.480
This is all for nothing
if we mess up now!

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:47.980
- How's the Lorenzinni look?
- Huang's calibrating it.

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:51.280
Get moving! I'm not gonna
be beaten by some little kid!

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:59.160
Calibration, complete.

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:28.190
Okay, lower it!
Slowly! Slowly!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:31.480
Yeah, that's the way.
Nice and slow!

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:35.570
Don't try to hide it.
Your last cards are nukes, right?

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:38.870
They're all we have left
to use now!

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:42.490
So, in the end, there's
no difference between either side.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:46.670
- Zorndyke's the enemy of mankind!
- So we have to kill him?

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:51.380
You just don't want to get
any blood on your own hands!

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.470
There's plenty of blood
on them already.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.650
Special head, huh?

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.280
Hold it!

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:21.830
Mr. Hayami, it's been a long time
since the two of us...

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:24.450
were in the submariner
officer's training academy.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:27.410
You've always made me sick!

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:28.420
Thank you.

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:31.630
Not because you always had to show off
how goddamned brilliant you were.

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.800
Because you have no sense of
responsibility or concern for anyone!

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:39.880
Just once, can't you think of others
or about what we're trying to accomplish?

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:41.260
Like HE does!

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:43.890
"He?"

00:17:55.570 --> 00:18:00.110
We in the Pacific Fleet are going
into Stream Base following his lead.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:04.910
He's the only man to ever make it back
from Zorndyke's base still alive.

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:07.080
He came back.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:11.620
The beast mutation process is proceeding
quickly. It won't be long now.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.040
You can read about it
in the report.

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:17.630
He became that way
because of your selfishness.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:20.720
Katsuma.

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:26.970
"KATSUMA!"

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.600
<i>"See you around, Hayami."</i>

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:42.360
What's wrong, Huang?
Shouldn't you be with Yamada?

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:45.870
I hear the songs.

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:49.620
Songs? You mean dolphin songs?
Or whales?

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:55.460
Dolphin songs are happy.
Yellow and orange.

00:18:55.710 --> 00:19:00.010
But these. They're black.
They're just black.

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:03.180
So many of them.
I can't count them all!

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:07.350
Hayami!

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:11.600
Hayami, where are you?

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:20.280
<i>Warning from</i>
<i>NOVO system thirteen!</i>

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:23.530
<i>Sonar contact.</i>
<i>Four enemy vessels!</i>

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:26.530
Were you followed, Blue 6?

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:48.930
We've found them.
We've finally found them!

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:52.060
Kill all of the Blue in there!

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:02.070
The flags.
Don't forget the flags!

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:11.080
<i>Warning! Change course!</i>
<i>Warning! Warning!</i>

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.380
Those idiot machines.
Destroy them!

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:22.920
<i>Game set. Gam...</i>

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:26.970
They've broken through the
primary NOVO system defense line.

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:31.060
Enemy fleet
approaching zero line!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.980
Intercept them.
Send out the Blue Fleet!

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:42.570
Can't you open the gate?
We have to get out of here!

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.990
At this rate, the enemy'll destroy
Blue Dome and the entire fleet!

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.780
Captain!
Hayami's taking out a type T!

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:50.580
<i>Hayami! What do you think</i>
<i>you're doing?</i>

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:51.780
<i>How many minutes do you need?</i>

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:54.790
<i>Twenty. No, fifteen!</i>

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:56.790
<i>If the flooding goes on,</i>
<i>we can blow the gate ourselves.</i>

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:58.710
<i>Gotcha.</i>
<i>I'll see what I can do.</i>

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:00.790
Hey!

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:03.590
Hold it! Where are you going
by yourself?

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:04.510
<i>I'm through!</i>

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:10.090
I'm sick of doing it for mankind
or to avenge the deaths of others!

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:12.970
I'm going after the Phantom Ship!

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:17.100
If I get him, nothing else matters!
Now let me go!

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:18.390
<i>You've gotta be kidding!</i>

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:21.190
<i>What, are you trying to</i>
<i>be cool? Or to run away?</i>

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.520
<i>What are you talking about?</i>
<i>Come back!</i>

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:26.360
Garbage! Scum!

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.610
Come back, you jerk.

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:41.670
Where is it?

00:21:51.430 --> 00:21:52.890
Is she in one of those?

00:22:16.540 --> 00:22:19.370
Direct hit on armored gate.
Dock area severely damaged!

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:25.000
Gentlemen, give the evacuation order.
All hands to the survival sphere.

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:26.590
- Doctor!
- Do you mean?

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:31.550
I'm going to activate Unit B Push.
You people, get to the pod!

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:34.100
I'll stay here and run things
till the very end!

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.930
Have the Musucas fall back!

00:22:37.310 --> 00:22:40.350
Weak! They're so weak, Verg!

00:22:40.770 --> 00:22:41.890
Pathetic.

00:22:42.020 --> 00:22:45.360
When they can't send their ships out,
the Blue base is just a lump of metal!

00:22:51.410 --> 00:22:52.280
Outta my way!

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:22.270
- The Shinha's falling!
- Open vents on the forward trim tank!

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:24.600
Emergency flood!
Get our nose down, fast!

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:27.270
So far.
We've come so far!

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:29.980
What about the main gate?
Isn't it open yet?

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:34.740
<i>Don't be sad about this.</i>

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:37.660
<i>This result is natural.</i>

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:43.500
<i>When science turned</i>
<i>its back on the flow of nature,</i>

00:23:43.620 --> 00:23:46.130
<i>mankind fell from its hand.</i>

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:53.010
The Blue Fleet can't be lost now!

00:23:56.050 --> 00:23:59.560
<i>Marunami, you've fought well.</i>

00:24:00.310 --> 00:24:03.100
<i>Can't we both see the future</i>
<i>which must come,</i>

00:24:04.230 --> 00:24:05.940
<i>my old friend.</i>

00:24:10.900 --> 00:24:11.820
Kill them!

00:25:40.200 --> 00:25:44.760
<i>Ne ikenai anata ni fureta
Tell me, is it wrong? I want to touch you.</i>

00:25:44.760 --> 00:25:47.650
<i>Kasanaru yori fukai
Deeper and deeper into you.</i>

00:25:47.650 --> 00:25:49.540
<i>Sweet whisper...</i>

00:25:49.540 --> 00:25:54.160
<i>Modokashi ore
I want to vanish...</i>

00:25:54.160 --> 00:25:57.340
<i>Takata ni kieta
...into the foam in the tantalizing orange light...</i>

00:25:57.340 --> 00:26:00.910
<i>Tsuki e no michi wo
Will the moonlight path on the waves...</i>

00:26:00.910 --> 00:26:05.960
<i>Anata e to tsuzuku kashira
...lead me to you, I wonder...</i>

00:26:05.960 --> 00:26:10.470
<i>Wasurerarenai atsui manazashi
I can't forget that warm gaze...</i>

00:26:10.470 --> 00:26:14.950
<i>Soshite amai toiki
...and that sweet sigh.</i>

00:26:19.340 --> 00:26:22.980
<i>Susarei de lullaby
That whispered lullaby...</i>

00:26:28.350 --> 00:26:32.360
<i>Eien lullaby
That eternal lullaby...</i>

00:26:32.890 --> 00:26:37.250
<i>Come whisper to me and touch me...</i>

00:26:37.250 --> 00:26:41.730
<i>Tokimeki wa ren'ai kotoba wa ren'ai
I'm dizzy from my beating heart, don't need any words now.</i>

00:26:41.730 --> 00:26:44.920
<i>Whisper love...</i>

00:27:01.870 --> 00:27:10.720
<i>Setsunaku ayamii anata no toiki ni
Your dangerous sigh that almost breaks my heart...</i>

00:27:11.150 --> 00:27:13.910
<i>Just whisper...</i>

00:27:14.470 --> 00:27:18.380
<i>...and love sweet touch.</i>

00:27:28.700 --> 00:27:37.680
<i>Setsunaku ayamii anata no toiki ni
Your dangerous sigh that almost breaks my heart...</i>

00:27:37.680 --> 00:27:41.720
<i>Sweet whisper... dakaredai
Sweet whisper... I want to embrace you...</i>

00:27:41.720 --> 00:27:43.970
<i>...and love sweet touch.</i>

00:27:44.400 --> 00:27:46.460
<i>Mitaretai
I want to go mad...</i>

00:27:46.630 --> 00:27:55.480
<i>Setsunaku ayamii anata no toiki ni
Your dangerous sigh that almost breaks my heart...</i>

00:27:55.820 --> 00:27:59.540
<i>Sweet whisper... Mitaretai
Sweet whisper... I want to go mad...</i>

00:27:59.540 --> 00:28:02.320
<i>...and love sweet touch.</i>

00:28:02.320 --> 00:28:04.620
<i>Kutsuretai
I want to crumble away...</i>

00:28:04.620 --> 00:28:09.040
<i>Agareru omoe wa
These burning feelings...</i>

00:28:09.040 --> 00:28:13.490
<i>Mina soko ni nemure
...are sleeping deep inside of everyone.</i>

00:28:14.020 --> 00:28:18.760
<i>Yume tsumeru made
Until we awaken from this dream...</i>

00:28:19.240 --> 00:28:21.160
<i>Sweet whisper...</i>

00:28:22.180 --> 00:28:29.580
<i>Mina soko ni nemure...
Sleeping deep inside everyone...</i>

00:28:47.010 --> 00:28:51.220
<i>Blue Submarine No. 6.</i>
<i>Episode 3: "Hearts."</i>
